<title>FRANCE: IBCA puts Cr. National on creditwatch.</title>
<headline>IBCA puts Cr. National on creditwatch.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>IBCA said it was putting Credit National and BFCE short term A1 and long term A notes on creditwatch with negative implications due to poor half-year results.</p>
<p>IBCA said it was also putting Credit National's intrinsic C note on creditwatch with negative implications.</p>
<p>IBCA said it would meet with company executives and examine the company's development plan for 1996-1998 and issue a definitive opinion as soon as possible.</p>
<p>Credit National took control of BFCE earlier this year.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +331 4221 5452</p>
